ved; stock sold off post-report |\n| MU (Micron)                  | +5.2% (premarket) to $742                                 | AI infrastructure rally on Anthropic IPO                                 |\n| WDC (Western Digital)        | +9.0%                                                     | AI infrastructure rally                                                  |\n| STX (Seagate)                | +7.6% to $555.20                                          | AI infrastructure rally                                                  |\n| COHR (Coherent)              | +10.9% to $237.75                                         | AI infrastructure rally                                                  |\n| CRWV (CoreWeave)             | +8.5% to $51.89                                           | AI infrastructure rally                                                  |\n| PLTR (Palantir)              | +5.7% to $165.58                                          | AI sentiment rally                                                       |\n| DELL                         | +6.6% to $333.87                                          | AI infrastructure/Nvidia tailwind                                        |\n| IREN                         | +6.0%                                                     | Nvidia earnings read-through                                             |\n| INTC                         | +4.6% (premarket)                                         | CEO Lip-Bu Tan comments at TomorrowX Summit                              |\n| LRCX (Lam Research)          | +4.3% (premarket)                                         | Semiconductor rally                                                      |\n| AMAT (Applied Materials)     | +4.2% (premarket)                                         | Semiconductor rally                                                      |\n| KLA                          | +2.1%                                                     | Semiconductor rally                                                      |\n| ASML                         | +4.9% to €1,322                                           | European chip rally                                                      |\n| MDB (MongoDB)                | +4.1%                                                     | UBS upgrade from Neutral to Buy                                          |\n| TU (Telus)                   | +10.4%                                                    | National Bank Financial upgrade                                          |\n| RPRX (Royalty Pharma)        | —                                                         | TD Cowen named top pharma pick for 2027                                  |\n| TM (Toyota)                  | —                                                         | Moody&#x27;s upgraded outlook to positive; 314K vehicle recall                |\n| AAPL                         | —                                                         | Camera software chief retired; UK tribunal confirmed data access order   |\n| MCD                          | —                                                         | Appointed former McKinsey partner as US strategy head                    |\n| TGT (Target)                 | —                                                         | Q3 beat on every line; adj. EPS $2.65                                    |\n| TJX                          | Closed +8.05% prior session                               | Strong earnings; pre-market follow-through                               |\n| LOW (Lowe&#x27;s)                 | —                                                         | Beat top and bottom line; gross margin pressure noted                    |\n| INTU (Intuit)                | $314.45                                                   | Reports after close Nov 19                                               |\n| VALE (Valvoline)             | +10.3% to $36.82                   